# Skill repository maintainer

Follow this repository's `FORMAT.md` and validation commands. Keep canonical
source under `skills/`, runtime dependencies under the documented client roots,
and repository-specific bindings in overlays. Validate the exact changed
artifacts before proposing publication and stop at every remote-action boundary.